From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 12:20:29 -0647
Subject: [PATCH] power: supply: Add the Maxim MAX77779 charger

Add a driver for the MAX77779's charger, which the Pixel 9a runs under
its OTP defaults. It reports whether an input (USB or the wireless
receiver) is present, the charge status and type from CHG_DETAILS_01,
the input current limit and the charge current, and supplies the fuel
gauge, so the battery's status follows the charger.

charge_behaviour inhibit-charge stops charging: the charger goes to
buck-only mode (CHG_CNFG_00 mode 4; that register isn't behind CHGPROT)
and USB powers the system, though near full the battery still supplies
part of the load; auto, unbinding and shutdown put it back in charge-
and-buck mode. An inhibit survives a warm reboot, since the PMIC stays
powered, so probe takes the inhibit state from the mode it finds.
Nothing else is written, and the interrupt registers (clear on read) are
not read: the state is polled every 10 s.

Tested on the Pixel 9a, with the device created at 0x69 by hand in place
of the out-of-tree driver it replaces: online, status, charge type,
input current limit (1.5 A) and charge current read as the chip reports
them; inhibit-charge gives "Not charging" (mode 4) and auto "Charging"
(mode 5) again; unbinding while inhibited leaves mode 5; and probing
with the charger found in mode 4 reports inhibit-charge and "Not
charging", and auto then restores mode 5. At 99 % the battery still gave
about 450 mA while inhibited, measured the same way with the out-of-tree
driver. The gauge's link to the charger comes from the DT and was not
part of this test.

Register fields from Google's MAX77779 charger driver and register
header.

Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/google-modules/bms/+/183509aff980610401869deca9f6ce8836980fe7/max77779_charger.c
Link: https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/google-modules/bms/+/183509aff980610401869deca9f6ce8836980fe7/max77779_v20240115_regs.h
Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
